  "_debris": "Loose material on top of the floor, synthesised by js/debris.js (the backend ignores it). grains: expected count per step at full amount, frequency band [fLo, fHi] of each grain's little modal bank, its Q and number of modes, level (loudest grain, relative), tick (contact noise), snap (chance of a brittle crack), release (activity when the load falls). settle: late tumbling grains. hiss: band-passed friction noise riding the load. force: how hard grains push the deck (makes the floor ring). damp: how much the layer softens the shoe click and the high-frequency fill at full amount.",
